---
// Footer 100% en español para TuCarroYM
---

<footer class="bg-[#080d19] text-slate-400 text-xs pt-12 pb-8 px-4 sm:px-8 border-t border-slate-800">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-8 pb-10 border-b border-slate-800/80">
    
    <!-- Col 1: Catálogos -->
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Catálogos</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px]">
        <li><a href="/vehiculos" class="hover:text-[#00c982]">Inventario General</a></li>
        <li><a href="/brands" class="hover:text-[#00c982]">Directorio de Marcas</a></li>
        <li><a href="/publicar" class="hover:text-[#00c982]">Publicar Vehículo</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Col 2: Soporte -->
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Soporte</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px]">
        <li><a href="/contacto" class="hover:text-[#00c982]">Centro de Ayuda</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contacto" class="hover:text-[#00c982]">Preguntas Frecuentes</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contacto" class="hover:text-[#00c982]">Atención VIP WhatsApp</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Col 3: Enlaces -->
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Enlaces</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px]">
        <li><a href="/nosotros" class="hover:text-[#00c982]">Sobre Nosotros</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contacto" class="hover:text-[#00c982]">Términos y Condiciones</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contacto" class="hover:text-[#00c982]">Políticas de Privacidad</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Col 4: Soluciones -->
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Soluciones</h4>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px]">
        <li><a href="/panel" class="hover:text-[#00c982]">Panel para Dealers</a></li>
        <li><a href="/publicar" class="hover:text-[#00c982]">Venta de Flotillas</a></li>
        <li><a href="/vehiculos" class="hover:text-[#00c982]">Maquinaria Pesada</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Col 5: Redes Sociales -->
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Síguenos</h4>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-300">
        <a href="#" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-[#00c982] hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="YouTube">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-youtube text-[11px]"></i>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-[#00c982] hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="Facebook">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f text-[11px]"></i>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-[#00c982] hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="Instagram">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-instagram text-[11px]"></i>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-[#00c982] hover:text-white transition-colors" aria-label="TikTok">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-tiktok text-[11px]"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Bottom Brand Row con Logo TuCarroYM -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[#00c982] flex items-center justify-center text-white font-black text-xs">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M8 17a2 2 0 100 4 2 2 0 000-4zm10 0a2 2 0 100 4 2 2 0 000-4zM5 11l1.5-4.5A2 2 0 018.4 5h7.2a2 2 0 011.9 1.5L19 11M3 11h18v6H3v-6z"></path></svg>
      </div>
      <span class="text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">
        TUCARRO<span class="text-[#00c982]">YMAS</span>
      </span>
      <span class="ml-2">&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} TuCarroYMas.com — República Dominicana. Todos los derechos reservados.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="text-slate-400">
      Arquitectura Crocoblock Car Dealer New
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<!-- Barra flotante inferior en español -->
<div class="fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 bg-[#0b1329] text-white py-2 px-4 border-t border-white/10 hidden sm:flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full flex items-center justify-between">
    <span>¿Quieres vender tu vehículo o maquinaria en República Dominicana? Publica tu anuncio gratis.</span>
    <a href="/publicar" class="bg-[#00c982] hover:bg-[#00b072] text-white font-bold px-3 py-1 text-xs rounded-sm transition-colors">
      Publicar Ahora
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
